# 0x0064 CLIENT_DAMAGE -- server->client, 24 bytes FIXED. Player RECEIVING damage.
#
# Source: live reference server, port 3573 (sector), cleartext
# proxy<->server UDP leg, KillLoot2 capture frame #3 (reassembled inner frame;
# see plans/33). Source 0x000187EC deals 4.9 damage to player 0x4003992A.
# Paired with the "dealt" fixture: the player GameID moves from @16 to @20,
# proving both fields are entity GameIDs (source/target), NOT a weapon effectDesc.
#
# Decode (matches ClientDamageRecord):
#   @0  Damage     4.9      (CD CC 9C 40)
#   @4  Modifier   -2.1     (66 66 06 C0)
#   @8  Type       3
#   @12 Inflicted  1
#   @16 SourceId   0x000187EC   <- the other combatant
#   @20 TargetId   0x4003992A   <- the PLAYER
CD CC 9C 40 66 66 06 C0 03 00 00 00 01 00 00 00 EC 87 01 00 2A 99 03 40
